                                                "sense_id": "e5a93028-ca68-3c84-8a3a-5819bd81802d",
                                                "text": "Mr. Bingley was good-looking and gentlemanlike; he had a pleasant countenance, and easy, unaffected manners."
                                            }
                                        ]
